+
+- **Find implicit invokable route handlers.** Registered Laravel literal and class-constant actions contribute scoped `__invoke` references and declaration counts, including inherited handlers, aliases and namespace qualification. Rebinding invalidates zero-hit and differently-cased count caches. PHP class navigation stays separate; namespace-dependent class constants and fixed magic-method contract renames refuse partial edits. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Keep incremental enum publication responsive.** Incremental class-cache population remains on the AST merge-lock owner so lazy builtin or vendor class parsing can safely reenter publication. Startup population remains parallel. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
